Subject: [PATCH] docs: allow kvdb and wsdb in cspell (aztec-packages #24392)

The native-packages consumption patch introduces both names into pins.mjs and
the @aztec/native sources. The indexed/nullifier tree reference update that
accompanied this originally is dropped: upstream removed that references
frontmatter entirely.

diff --git a/cspell.json b/cspell.json
index a07b21daf4de3f7db27dc5d85d8c9d482467d9bf..894f9fe9fa99db527698ee8edb4cd71b3f4e1440 100644
--- a/cspell.json
+++ b/cspell.json
@@ -194,6 +194,7 @@
     "libp",
     "linkability",
     "llms",
+    "kvdb",
     "lmdb",
     "macroified",
     "maddiaa",
@@ -400,6 +401,7 @@
     "webassembly",
     "WITGEN",
     "workdir",
+    "wsdb",
     "yamls",
     "yamux",
     "yarnrc",
